<title>JAPAN: Asahi Brew says 120 yen/dlr good for Japan economy.</title>
<headline>Asahi Brew says 120 yen/dlr good for Japan economy.</headline>
<dateline>KYOTO, Japan 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Breweries Ltd chairman Hirotaro Higuchi told a business symposium on Thursday that a dollar-yen exchange rate of around 120 yen is a positive factor for the Japanese economy.  </p>
<p>&quot;Although sharp fluctuations are not good, an exchange rate of around 120 yen to the dollar should be positive for the Japanese economy,&quot; Higuchi said.</p>
<p>Higuchi also said recent sharp declines in Japanese stock prices were caused by problems limited to certain parts of the banking and construction sectors, saying that prices of some blue chip companies had remained firm.</p>
</text>
